 "segments": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.35,
   "e": 9.303,
   "text": "To understand our architectural predicament, let us turn our attention to the only definitive proof of general intelligence in the known universe:",
   "dur": 8.953,
   "voiced": 602,
   "sim": 0.673,
   "f0": 115.452,
   "st": -0.669,
   "range_st": 3.198,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 9.578,
   "e": 10.82,
   "text": "the biological brain.",
   "dur": 1.242,
   "voiced": 81,
   "sim": 0.509,
   "f0": 109.881,
   "st": -1.525,
   "range_st": 3.561,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 5,
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 11.52,
   "e": 16.995,
   "text": "A human brain operates on an astonishingly modest power budget of approximately twenty watts.",
   "dur": 5.475,
   "voiced": 381,
   "sim": 0.804,
   "f0": 117.946,
   "st": -0.299,
   "range_st": 5.77,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 18.076,
   "e": 22.71,
   "text": "That is roughly the energy consumed by a dim refrigerator light bulb.",
   "dur": 4.634,
   "voiced": 337,
   "sim": 0.573,
   "f0": 112.229,
   "st": -1.159,
   "range_st": 3.559,
   "asr": 0.96,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 23.731,
   "e": 31.011,
   "text": "Yet within that microscopic energy footprint, the brain coordinates eighty-six billion living neurons",
   "dur": 7.28,
   "voiced": 493,
   "sim": 0.759,
   "f0": 118.913,
   "st": -0.157,
   "range_st": 3.461,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 31.149,
   "e": 36.069,
   "text": "and over one hundred trillion synaptic junctions with breathtaking cognitive efficiency.",
   "dur": 4.92,
   "voiced": 323,
   "sim": 0.831,
   "f0": 120.173,
   "st": 0.025,
   "range_st": 4.692,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 37.405,
   "e": 40.565,
   "text": "Crucially, the biological brain is never static.",
   "dur": 3.16,
   "voiced": 212,
   "sim": 0.822,
   "f0": 118.327,
   "st": -0.243,
   "range_st": 9.446,
   "asr": 0.857,
   "attempts": 3,
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 41.412,
   "e": 43.616,
   "text": "It is in perpetual topological motion.",
   "dur": 2.204,
   "voiced": 181,
   "sim": 0.757,
   "f0": 119.146,
   "st": -0.124,
   "range_st": 7.07,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 3,
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 43.836,
   "e": 49.434,
   "text": "Through continuous neurogenesis, dendritic arborization, and synaptic spine pruning,",
   "dur": 5.598,
   "voiced": 343,
   "sim": 0.868,
   "f0": 119.501,
   "st": -0.072,
   "range_st": 6.134,
   "asr": 0.889,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 49.904,
   "e": 54.792,
   "text": "neural circuits physically restructure themselves in real time based on sensory experience.",
   "dur": 4.888,
   "voiced": 330,
   "sim": 0.821,
   "f0": 120.52,
   "st": 0.075,
   "range_st": 5.818,
   "asr": 0.88,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 55.651,
   "e": 59.526,
   "text": "Under the governing laws of spike-timing-dependent plasticity,",
   "dur": 3.876,
   "voiced": 282,
   "sim": 0.824,
   "f0": 129.305,
   "st": 1.293,
   "range_st": 8.158,
   "asr": 0.824,
   "attempts": 2,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 59.68,
   "e": 62.98,
   "text": "if two neurons repeatedly fire in temporal synchrony,",
   "dur": 3.3,
   "voiced": 254,
   "sim": 0.723,
   "f0": 118.692,
   "st": -0.19,
   "range_st": 8.802,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 63.365,
   "e": 72.016,
   "text": "the biochemical junction between them physically thickens, synthesizing new AMPA and NMDA receptors to reinforce the connection.",
   "dur": 8.652,
   "voiced": 489,
   "sim": 0.726,
   "f0": 119.375,
   "st": -0.09,
   "range_st": 5.185,
   "asr": 0.941,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 72.848,
   "e": 75.703,
   "text": "Conversely, if a pathway remains inactive,",
   "dur": 2.855,
   "voiced": 208,
   "sim": 0.796,
   "f0": 119.649,
   "st": -0.051,
   "range_st": 8.558,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 3,
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 75.821,
   "e": 83.941,
   "text": "microglia and astrocytic processes prune the unused synapses to conserve precious metabolic energy.",
   "dur": 8.12,
   "voiced": 468,
   "sim": 0.884,
   "f0": 121.267,
   "st": 0.182,
   "range_st": 6.563,
   "asr": 0.923,
   "attempts": 2,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 84.801,
   "e": 89.059,
   "text": "The living brain does not separate training from inference.",
   "dur": 4.258,
   "voiced": 220,
   "sim": 0.822,
   "f0": 123.444,
   "st": 0.49,
   "range_st": 10.606,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 89.365,
   "e": 92.446,
   "text": "Every single percept you process, every sentence you read,",
   "dur": 3.08,
   "voiced": 210,
   "sim": 0.746,
   "f0": 118.809,
   "st": -0.173,
   "range_st": 5.053,
   "asr": 0.889,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 92.7,
   "e": 95.087,
   "text": "and every thought you formulate",
